WEBVTT

00:00:57.208 --> 00:01:01.976
are grappling with feelings of anger
and frustration, deep, deep sadness

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:04.518
and really helplessness.

00:01:04.542 --> 00:01:06.351
No matter who you are,

00:01:06.375 --> 00:01:08.976
you have questions about what to do now,

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:10.643
how to make things better.

00:01:10.667 --> 00:01:12.684
And as we've seen,

00:01:12.708 --> 00:01:16.226
violence like this unfolds
for many, many years.

00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:18.042
What is the path forward?

00:01:22.458 --> 00:01:23.708
CA: So --

00:01:26.917 --> 00:01:29.268
We're joined today
by a group of activists,

00:01:29.292 --> 00:01:31.434
organizers and leaders